OL,3,GNEWSA#800,000 spent on scrapped sports
OL,4,Adome project
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Northern Ireland university spent
OL,7,F#800,000 on a planned indoor sports
OL,8,Fdome in Londonderry before the project
OL,9,Fwas scrapped.
OL,11,FPlans for Ulster University's (UU)
OL,12,Fmultimillion pound dome, which was to
OL,13,Fhouse multiple sports, including rugby,
OL,14,Ffootball and Gaelic games, were first
OL,15,Fannounced in 2024.
OL,17,FBut in August UU axed the project
OL,18,Fsaying it was no longer financially
OL,19,Fviable.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
