OL,3,GNEWSA#800,000 spent on scrapped sports
OL,4,Adome project
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe university, which earlier this year
OL,7,Fannounced it needed to make savings of
OL,8,Fabout #25m and would be making up to
OL,9,F450 staff redundant, has revealed it
OL,10,Fspent hundreds of thousands of pounds
OL,11,Fon the dome project before it was axed.
